# Sealed contract PDFs. `ALMACEN_DOCUMENTOS_RUTA` defaults to `var/documentos`
# (apps/api/src/config/configuracion.ts), relative to wherever the API runs —
# so signing anything locally, and running the integration suite, writes real
# PDFs here. Each one carries a customer's name, DNI and signature image.
#
# Committing one would put personal data into version control permanently,
# where deleting the file does not remove it from history. This is Ley 25.326
# data, and the repository is the one place it must never reach.
var/

